SWEET bench end marker (patch 0155, flow v2 item 6): the Home-key bench (sweethidtest=N seconds, now sweethidcount=P presses, default 30) and the synthetic swipes of 0152 (sweetswipecount=K, default 400) print ONE final line `SWEET BENCH DONE: home-key presses P` / `SWEET BENCH DONE: swipes K` 6 s after the last release/swipe, so a run can end on it (--expect "SWEET BENCH DONE") instead of a fixed --duration. Applies on top of 0152. No hardware access.
--- a/iokit/Kernel/arm/hid/SweetHID.cpp
+++ b/iokit/Kernel/arm/hid/SweetHID.cpp
@@ -339,6 +339,7 @@
 	IOTimerEventSource *fTest;
 	UInt32 fTestSecs;
 	UInt32 fTestCount;
+	UInt32 fTestLimit;   /* patch 0155: events (2 per press) before the bench is done, boot-arg sweethidcount presses, default 30 */
 };
 OSDefineMetaClassAndStructors(SweetHIDButtons, IOHIDEventService);
 
@@ -376,10 +377,12 @@
 	/* patch 0152: synthetic swipes (boot-arg sweetswipe=N seconds), a repeatable touch source for latency measurements */
